VALUES ('2c677675-2463-483c-8858-8dba70b33dbe', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'Principal Institutions of the Organization • The Assembly of the Heads of State and Government: the organization’s supreme organ which met once a year, in a different capital city, although it could also meet in extraordinary session; • The Council of Ministers: normally met twice a year or in special sessions. Subordinate to the Assembly of Heads of State and Government, the council’s principal responsibility was preparing the assembly’s agenda; • The General Secretariat: headed by a secretary-general, appointed by the Assembly of Heads of State and Government. The secretariat was responsible for the administration of the OAU.', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[0.008556416,0.009651596,-0.01531138,-0.009331627,0.01752246,-0.0029877233,-0.001973969,-0.00043443101,-0.0024806147,-0.08611965,-0.03519815,0.013684021,-0.004906269,0.037171163,-0.010945138,-0.020324815,-0.02300707,-0.0026052871,0.017934404,-0.0056095263,0.034839354,0.012947826,0.028563099,-0.0011516964,-0.04613057,0.02138069,0.0055451337,-0.055005845,-0.024770131,0.20056604,-0.0049161226,-0.00034526808,0.016115172,0.021367887,0.0022515873,0.01027048,-0.027991604,-0.02612943,0.018752296,-0.046750803,0.0051165638,-0.016858269,-0.025428174,0.087666824,0.012962908,-0.011625733,0.027679367,0.03854273,0.0072412146,-0.010182305,0.029781818,0.0035445783,0.0047136773,-0.039809536,0.025337057,0.047980055,0.007275382,-0.03800316,-0.0009945041,0.0049831946,-0.0047421143,0.035419755,-0.027466023,0.0376557,0.0010807893,0.028847104,0.016755035,-0.033930313,0.023866352,-0.0014613883,-0.021606829,0.0014582506,0.013797194,-0.004915636,-0.03741177,-0.016737342,-0.009190615,0.03007936,0.037473466,-0.0064817904,0.023892246,0.028743321,-0.009633713,0.006732037,-0.010387376,-0.0012813351,-0.022104684,0.030473115,0.069698654,0.017914744,-0.029130185,0.030449823,-0.016156105,-0.06616584,-0.0029305012,-0.012613021,0.0