VALUES ('752605d5-6600-4d94-bf44-7a4429616f7f', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'Shimgelina Among the Amhara people, the main indigenous conflict resolution mechanism is Shimgelina, which is comparable to the Jarsuumma of the Oromo people. In this indigenous conflict resolution mechanism, five Shimageles (elders) would be appointed by the disputing parties themselves based on their choice. They are recognized as solution makers since they have the power to make binding decisions and impose History Grade 10 Student Textbook solutions on behalf of the parties. They can sanction social measures in case one of the parties fails to comply with the ruling or agreement. The Shimageles often follow up on agreements and strive to improve relationships in post-meditation sessions.', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[-0.00028619907,0.032755077,-0.016761573,-0.029978016,0.010255247,-0.010818041,0.008405363,0.0021614586,-0.0059232097,-0.10495086,-0.020198632,0.011241364,0.031872287,0.056284007,-0.040112935,-0.023862919,0.06201121,0.012685494,0.04121307,0.0057674553,0.016217323,-0.009032775,0.070558086,0.01828424,-0.037171073,0.012799257,0.020029237,-0.02729778,-0.030617576,0.20155205,-0.020948477,-0.0008223397,-0.016504984,-0.032171506,0.033207007,-0.0004593713,-0.011808034,-0.028857782,0.061387423,-0.03503651,0.0073443763,-0.021213086,0.020048,0.058797758,0.026435785,-0.0065790275,-0.013922794,0.035982203,-0.00009011564,-0.008901845,0.016727036,-0.028461123,0.033022307,-0.059353843,0.035179768,-0.027273595,0.030893186,-0.02228968,0.055103455,0.052390326,-0.02522093,0.009491659,-0.0011633674,0.04777792,-0.015012766,0.019867983,0.077385426,-0.0022163775,0.029560298,0.03890737,0.035280026,-0.0033966324,0.003974614,0.0035525,0.028551891,-0.020934908,-0.017077966,0.033898816,0.029062405,0.06372479,0.0033105751,0.0068408907,-0.041855633,0.003461532,0.012477245,-0.05956286,0.011234468,0.030626766,-0.021835532,-0.014852311,-0.034935653,0.05052537,-0.0