VALUES ('37ce5100-61ee-41e4-9f96-9b7f91046a7a', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'Fiche-Chambalaalla was inscribed on the representative list of the intangible cultural heritage of humanity in 2015. 13. Timket, Ethiopian Epiphany: The festival of Timiket or Epiphany to commemorate the baptism of Jesus in the Jordan River is celebrated across Ethiopia on January 19 th or th in the leap year. This festival is best known for its ritual reenactment of baptism. It has become the fourth for Ethiopia in the list of UNESCO intangible cultural heritage lists in 2019. History Grade 10 Student Textbook', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[-0.007893231,-0.01887747,-0.0105935875,-0.018126778,-0.010807757,-0.014546357,0.014568436,-0.02640363,-0.0034279504,-0.12095127,-0.02901862,-0.0019457508,0.026421018,0.041465815,-0.047461007,-0.028261771,0.037126686,0.01927128,0.022196207,-0.015374542,0.01933203,0.009214527,-0.02072843,0.0037679307,-0.052095063,0.010075924,0.041687865,-0.045314875,-0.0108619165,0.20801485,-0.038190003,-0.0053659654,0.019917388,-0.046216216,-0.0032862104,-0.0016007775,-0.010014769,-0.017447328,0.06400511,-0.04008847,-0.018149277,-0.018833825,0.015429455,0.027834514,-0.0004608554,-0.058009513,-0.043207936,0.042795837,0.013307207,-0.014370303,0.005326734,-0.0069518187,0.021535026,-0.0050880737,0.030776283,0.024246892,0.031469665,-0.028155856,0.044746503,0.014273706,-0.007835582,-0.022794213,-0.009329707,0.033800572,0.004300594,-0.012382066,0.057609115,-0.006166645,0.04382824,0.037112705,0.024415052,0.0018498113,0.027900983,-0.035639323,-0.029828755,0.011122538,-0.046304576,0.011188626,0.02334173,0.043912593,-0.0039906013,0.02106694,-0.05986411,0.04176355,0.01876607,-0.04163332,0.023215566,-0.027315492,0.016604753,-0.017387697,-0.067129694,0.020093793,0.0268601,-0.032405064,-0.007052666,-0.008487877,-0.033183616,-0.01494072,0.031611495,0.0077040354,-0.034484193,0.00076908286,-0.01890518,0.024454454,0.05345658,-0.0324243,0.02536085