VALUES ('5015b65c-eb12-4447-9972-7d578a56baaf', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000400', 'Temples Ethiopia has several temples which can be classified as tangible heritages. Some of these temples date back to the Pre-Christian era. The well-known ones are the temple of Yeha, the old cathedral of St. Mary of Zion at Aksum, Rock-hewn Churches of Lalibela, monasteries and others. The Temple of Yeha is located in Yeha, northeast Adwa. This is a tower built in the Sabaean style and dated through comparison with ancient structures in South Arabia to around 700BC.', 'G10-History-STB-2023-web.pdf p.1', '2026.1', 'published', '[-0.0035973205,-0.0040836628,0.02845235,-0.038439214,0.0112954825,-0.010475483,0.0022702469,0.012162381,-0.0075602327,-0.08498855,-0.018443525,0.007876324,0.026785154,0.041619893,-0.016853757,-0.052896205,0.0028907147,0.0007177927,0.054777037,0.0050573456,0.0035322509,0.03827453,0.005888075,0.027145581,-0.028737154,-0.00249293,-0.00045489555,-0.029471215,-0.011484917,0.16305056,-0.027777256,-0.022881176,0.01293861,-0.027395843,0.018228484,-0.023716025,-0.0075641554,-0.04681482,0.07146491,-0.06555918,0.049232718,0.005488571,0.015383998,0.016459566,0.019405084,-0.050783426,0.002448985,0.04334499,-0.023436174,-0.022961777,-0.005155704,0.000120163335,0.038238585,-0.04603053,0.028602593,-0.002197924,0.031194696,0.0013544421,0.032349173,0.015983334,0.009506829,-0.02718955,-0.02215179,0.01116266,0.00879077,0.023291733,0.050638564,0.010905742,0.027701287,0.0020451497,-0.03290668,0.00485419,0.017518854,0.013981557,-0.0072769388,0.0277745,-0.018688032,0.00311659,0.019527256,0.02852223,-0.00940311,0.0042984453,-0.016095482,0.025904834,0.04355593,-0.049794443,0.042624395,0.010730265,0.027504517,0.010150187,-0.032322202,0.0034759603,0.026040269,-0.0025316172,0.011791031,0.015442793,-0.028235516,-0.034077406,-0.006313451,0.018348869,-0.06819334,-0.0043321787,0.0073735733,0.011171438,0.004590971,0.0021380656,-0.03215015,-0.005441694,0.028560434,-0.012695538,-0.0505645